@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Editar Recorrido

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "RouteCrudConsole" as Console
participant "GetRouteUseCase" as UCGet
participant "UpdateRouteUseCase" as UCUpdate
participant "RouteRepository" as Repo
participant "Route" as Entity
database "JSON (routes.json)" as DB

Admin -> Console: Seleccionar recorrido para editar
activate Console
Console -> UCGet: execute(id)
activate UCGet
UCGet -> Repo: findById(id)
activate Repo
Repo --> UCGet: route
deactivate Repo
UCGet --> Console: route
deactivate UCGet
Console --> Admin: Mostrar formulario con datos actuales

Admin -> Console: Modificar campos y guardar
Console -> UCUpdate: execute(id, data)
activate UCUpdate
UCUpdate -> Repo: findById(id)
activate Repo
Repo --> UCUpdate: route
deactivate Repo
UCUpdate -> Entity: updateAttributes(data)
activate Entity
Entity --> UCUpdate: updatedRoute
deactivate Entity
UCUpdate -> Repo: update(updatedRoute)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: Sobrescribir datos
activate DB
DB --> Repo: success
deactivate DB
Repo --> UCUpdate: success
deactivate Repo
UCUpdate --> Console: success
deactivate UCUpdate
Console --> Admin: Mostrar confirmación
deactivate Console

@enduml
